  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's approximate the number of boys and girls by rounding to the nearest hundred.\n\n- Boys: $331⟶300$\n\n- Girls: $457⟶500$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys is approximately\n\n$$\n\\frac{500}{300}.\n$$\n\nDividing the numerator and denominator by $100$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{500÷100}{300÷100}=\\frac{5}{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys is approximately $\\frac{5}{3}.$",
